只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh-polyglot — the model switch for DSH: generic OpenAI-compatible ctx.llm adapter, curated free/cheap DeepSeek presets, automatic provider fallback on rate limits","id":"gh:1333323173","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-polyglot","slug":"Jesse-njx/dsh-polyglot","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","llm","openai-compatible","router"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh-polyglot — the model switch for DSH: generic OpenAI-compatible ctx.llm adapter, curated free/che"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ap DeepSeek presets, automatic provider fallback on rate limits"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-polyglot"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**The model switch for DSH.** Point DeepSeek Harness at any OpenAI-compatible\nendpoint — with curate"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"d presets for free and cheap DeepSeek providers and\nautomatic fallback when a free tier rate-limits "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"esets for free and cheap DeepSeek providers and\nautomatic fallback when a free tier rate-limits you."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"What claude-code-router is to Claude Code, dsh-polyglot is to DSH — except\nDSH's `ctx.llm` is a sanc"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"tioned extension seam, so there is no request\ninterception: the generic adapter and the router are b"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"oth real `LlmAdapter`\nregistrations."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **One generic adapter.** A single OpenAI-compatible `ctx.llm` adapter\nparameterized by `{baseUrl, "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"apiKey, model, headers?, quirks?}`. Streaming,\ntool calls, and usage extraction are all handled; per"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"-provider deviations\n(reasoning field names, strict tool schemas, cache-folded usage) are small\ndecl"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"arative `quirks` flags, never per-provider code.\n- **A router with fallback.** On 429 / quota-exceed"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ed / 5xx (or a missing\nkey), the failing provider is marked cooling-down (exponential backoff,\nhonor"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ing `Retry-After`) and the request is retried on the next provider in\nthe chain. Free tiers rate-lim"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"it constantly — automatic failover is the\nwhole product.\n- **Provider presets as data.** `presets/*."},{"id":"p5s8","text":"json` — community PRs add providers\nwithout touching the adapter. Each preset carries `verifiedAt` a"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"nd free-tier\nnotes so rot is visible.\n- **Usage you can see.** Every attempt lands in the append-onl"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"y session log as\n`polyglot/served`; `/polyglot usage` tallies per provider with token counts\nand est"},{"id":"p5s11","text":"imated cost from preset pricing."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Install the bundle into a profile (a DSH profile is an ordered stack of\nplugin-bundle patch layers):"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The bundle's patch registers the `polyglot` plugin with the recommended\ndefault chain — *\"code all d"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ay for free until something rate-limits, then\ndegrade gracefully to cheapest-paid\"*:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Configure keys through the credentials seam (the web Models page writes them),\nor export the env nam"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"es each preset declares:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Pick the virtual provider `polyglot` in the model selector. A provider without\na configured key is s"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"kipped automatically — the chain degrades, it never\nfails hard."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Day-to-day commands"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Command | What it does |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `/model` | show chains and the active one |\n| `/model <chain>` | switch the active chain mid-sessi"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"on (logged as `polyglot/chain`) |\n| `/polyglot` | status: active chain, entries, provider cooldowns "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"|\n| `/polyglot usage` | per-provider tally from the session log: calls, ok/failed, tokens, est. cost"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" |\n| `/polyglot presets` | free-tier posture of the active chain's presets |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Override `chains` and `cooldown` from your profile patch:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Per-entry overrides: `provider` (route name), `model`, `baseUrl`, `apiKeyEnv`,\n`headers`, `quirks` —"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" the `custom` preset is the escape hatch for\nvLLM/Ollama/SGLang localhost and any other OpenAI-compa"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"tible endpoint\n(Qwen/GLM/Kimi official APIs included)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Quirks reference"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Flag | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| `reasoningField` | `'reasoning_content'` | wire delta field carrying reasoning text; `null` disabl"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"es reasoning entirely |\n| `maxTokensField` | `'max_tokens'` | output-cap wire field (`max_completion"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"_tokens` for newer hosts) |\n| `usage` | `'standard'` | `'deepseek'` subtracts cache hits folded into"},{"id":"p23s4","text":" `prompt_tokens`; `'none'` when the host reports none |\n| `streamOptions` | `true` | send `stream_op"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"tions: {include_usage: true}` |\n| `strictToolSchemas` | `false` | add `strict: true` to tool schemas"},{"id":"p23s6","text":" |\n| `thinkingField` | `false` | send `thinking: {type}` (DeepSeek spelling) |\n| `reasoningEffortFie"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"ld` | `true` | send `reasoning_effort` for high/max efforts |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Preset registry"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"All figures were re-verified 2026-08-14 against provider docs; **these move\nweekly** — every preset "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"carries `verifiedAt`, and a CI job pinging each\n`baseUrl` with a 1-token request is the planned trus"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" `verifiedAt`, and a CI job pinging each\n`baseUrl` with a 1-token request is the planned trust loop."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Preset | What you get | Cost / limits | Notes |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `deepseek-official` | V4-Flash, V4-Pro | $0.14/$0.28 per M (Flash); **5M free tokens new accounts,"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" 30 days, no card** | Baseline; prices trending up |\n| `opencode-zen` | `deepseek-v4-flash-free` (+ "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"Qwen 3.6 Plus, MiniMax M3, MiMo…) | Free, no card, 200k context; rate limits undocumented | Commerci"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"al terms unclear — flagged in the preset `notes` |\n| `nous-portal` | `deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash:fre"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"e` | Free, OAuth-gated, hard rate ceiling that returns errors | The poster child for fallback; put i"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"t first in a chain |\n| `kilo` | V4-Pro, V4-Flash, V3.1 Terminus | Pay-as-you-go at **no markup** ove"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"r provider rates | Good paid-fallback rung |\n| `openrouter` | `:free` DeepSeek variants + everything"},{"id":"p27s8","text":" else | Free variants throttled; paid at listed rates | Widest catalog, one key |\n| `custom` | anyth"},{"id":"p27s9","text":"ing OpenAI-compatible | — | vLLM/Ollama/SGLang localhost; Qwen/GLM/Kimi official endpoints |\n| `groq"},{"id":"p27s10","text":"` / `together` / `fireworks` | DeepSeek hosting | fast but pricier | Latency upgrades, not savings |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The router forwards the first attempt that completes. A fallback-eligible\nfailure that arrives **bef"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ore any content flowed** — the free-tier ceiling\ncase — swaps to the next provider seamlessly; a fai"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"lure after content flowed\ncannot be unwritten and surfaces as a normal error finish. Which provider\n"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"actually served each turn is durable in the session log (`polyglot/served`),\nso `/polyglot usage` is"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" a pure fold over the log, not plugin-side accounting."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## ToS note"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Free tiers are often gated for evaluation use (OpenCode Zen's commercial\nterms are undocumented). Pr"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"eset `notes` surface this at configure time —\ndsh-polyglot does not silently launder usage."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- **v0.2** — per-role chains (planner → paid V4-Pro, executor/summarizer →\nfree Flash); OAuth device"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" flow for Nous Portal; preset auto-update check;\nprovider benchmark/arena integration.\n- **Non-goals"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"** — proxying non-chat modalities; silent key laundering."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
